<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n54087" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατακαίνω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατακτείνω</span>
			, <i>kill</i>, in early writers in aor. 2
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατέκανον</span>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				4.6.5
			</span></i> (
				v.l.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-καίνων</span>
			), <i><span class="en">
				<u>An.</u>
				3.2.12
			</span></i>; 3sg.
			subj.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατακάνῃ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Anon.
				</span></i>
			 in<i><span class="en">
				<u>PSI</u>
				9.1091.4
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατέκανον</span> (for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-έκτανον</span>) is required by the metre in
				<i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ant.</u>
				1340
			</span></i>: pf.
			part.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κεκονότες</span> (cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καίνω</span>) shd. be read in <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				7.6.36
			</span></i>: pres. in later Prose, <i><span class="en">
				Parth.
				7.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arr.
				<u>Ind.</u>
				11.10
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				App.
				<u>Pun.</u>
				1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Eun.
				<u>Hist.</u>
				p.212D.
			</span></i>; <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i> has <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατακαινιῶ: ἀποκτενῶ</span>
			(fort. leg. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατακενίω</span>, 
				Dor.
			
			fut.).</div>
